+.. ghc-flag:: -fghci-browser-static-file-server
+    :shortdesc: Wasm ghci browser mode static file server
+    :type: dynamic
+
+    :default: off
+
+    Specifies if a static file server should be used to deliver
+    additional frontend assets (e.g. `.css`, `.png`, `.html`, `.ico`)
+    from the current working directory.
+
+    Defaults to off.
+
+    Note: Static file servers can present security concerns,
+    recommended usage is only for local development.
+
